{"product_id":"cherub-new-guard-book-17","title":"CHERUB: New Guard: Book 17","description":"\u003cp\u003eJames Adams returns in the last ever book in the number one bestselling CHERUB series.'Crackling tension and high-octane drama' Daily MailRyan Sharma is a CHERUB agent. Working undercover, he can slip under adult radar and get information that sends criminals and terrorists to jail.Now he's investigating a double kidnapping, working with mission controller and old guard, James Adams.In the mission to end all missions, Ryan and James must assemble a team of legendary CHERUB agents to find the hostages and bring them home ...Don't miss the final and most exciting ever title in the bestselling CHERUB series.For official purposes, these children do not exist.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 133 x 229\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Robert Muchamore\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781444914122\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 320\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45487627239577,"sku":"7RG9781444914122","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68592c107dcc9-CHERUB-New-Guard-Book-17-Robert-Muchamore-_1.jpg?v=1753121289","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/cherub-new-guard-book-17","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}